{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act55side_level_act55side_02_end","storyGroup":"act55side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act55side_level_act55side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TL-2","storyName":"孑遗的道路","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"九一行人变装突围成功，与塔露拉和米拉娜会师；费奥多尔在侍从陪同下筹划去向，最终在雪地战场被西尔卡发现。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act55side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["塔露拉","雅罗米尔","紧急的战报","集团军指挥","斯韦特兰纳","米拉娜","雷德","九","费奥多尔","沉稳的侍从","轻佻的女性","寡言的女性","塔伊西亚","佐莱达","谨慎的步兵","？？？","西尔卡","警惕的声音","警惕的士兵","恍惚的青年"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"charslot","id":4},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":5},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"2","y":"100","id":6},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_79_g22_snowbase_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_talulha_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14d0d0/m_bat_talulha_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":11},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.35","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#6$3","duration":"0.5","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……不要再提起那个名字。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"这算什么？对你的敌人的请求？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"看上去你还在意自己犯下的罪孽。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"也好，用这把剑碾碎你要来得更直接点。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"哈……狂妄的感染者。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"我必须得承认，你的确算得上我见过最强大的战士。可你竟然妄图将这种力量用来对抗乌萨斯？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"你杀害了养育你的公爵，又在乌萨斯各处挑起动乱。你侥幸躲过了乌萨斯的审判逃去别的国家，现在竟敢又回到你背叛过的土地。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"是什么样的野心支持你做出这么多邪恶的举动？我一定得剖开你的心脏好好看看……看看你身上到底流淌着多么肮脏的血。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……我明白了。真遗憾，我没办法在这里戳破你信以为真的幻象。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"怎样才能让一个人理解他从来没有看见过的苦难，你甚至从来没有见过乌萨斯真正的样子。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"可想想你自己吧，你认为我们之间有什么区别？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你用这种程度的源石技艺强化自己的血肉之躯，充当乌萨斯锋利的爪牙。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你认为自己还有多久……也会成为感染者？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"……你不配诋毁我为乌萨斯做出的牺牲！","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"我在用自己的生命捍卫乌萨斯的荣耀，直到最后一刻，我也会作为战士而结束自己的生命！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"至于你们，背叛了故土的败类，你们永远失去了分享乌萨斯荣光的机会，那就变成喂养这片土地的养料——","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.8","channel":"1","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.6","channel":"2","delay":"0.3","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_battlefield_environment","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","id":44},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"怎么回事？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧急的战报","text":"雅罗米尔队长，我军派往东路的增援遭遇了埋伏！","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧急的战报","text":"不知道为什么，先头部队突然对增援部队发起了袭击！","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧急的战报","text":"天灾环境对通讯造成的影响太大了，战场很混乱，我们恐怕很难再维持阵线——","id":56},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$jealous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_jealous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":57,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"你说什么？！！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"意料之外的战报让青年难以克制，而当他意识到自己犯下的错时，一切都已经晚了。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"他抬起眼，目光紧盯着上一秒还被自己视为猎物的存在。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"看上去，你的部队并不如你期待的那样战无不胜。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"不要挑衅我。不过是耍了一点小把戏……军队想要碾死你们不过是轻而易举——","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"如果你想让更多的部队给你陪葬的话……试试看吧。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"再次见面的时候，我一定会让你偿还你对感染者的血债。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"但愿在那之前，你能认清你在为什么而战。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_ignite_cast","volume":"0.7","channel":"3","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firemagic","channel":"4","delay":"0.2","id":75},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","yto":"100","movetime":"0.5","y":"-100","x":"0","xto":"0","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"10","randomness":"20","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.4","b":"0.4","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"0.8","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":80},{"type":"bgeffect","id":81},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_scorchedearth","layer":"1","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":85},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#6$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"咳咳……！咳！","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#12$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"该死——！","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军指挥","text":"雅罗米尔队长，天灾已经很近了。行动不能再这样下去。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#14$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"给我通知战争术师……我不管他们用什么手段，我绝对不允许任何一个活着的感染者走出这片山林！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军指挥","text":"等等，在这个时候？！现在大规模施放法术随时可能引发天灾！","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#13$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"就算这样——","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#13$1","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":103},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","offset":"250,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":104},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"260,0","pto":"260,0","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"已经够了，雅罗米尔。","id":108},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"元帅？这是为什么——","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我对你说过的中央区的事态，又出现了我们意料之外的变化，具体的消息，我会当面告诉你。","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"尽快带部队回到驻地。","id":115},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"可是那些感染者，杀害了阿纳托利的凶手——","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"不过是一群被逐出了巢穴的鼷兽，就算放任他们不管，这个寒冬本身就能要了他们的命。","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"记住，孩子，你生来就背负着非凡的使命……你只该为那些高尚的事物而战。","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","id":124},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"……","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"bgeffect","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","y":"0","x":"0","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","id":136},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":140,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","loop":"true","channel":"run","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#1$3","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":143},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run","fadetime":"0.3","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#13$3","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"米拉娜！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"太好了……你平安无事……","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我们都平安无事。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"按照你的安排，我们在这里接应到了很多同伴。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"塔露拉，你是对的，你做到了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#2$3","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"不……这不是我的功劳……是每个人……","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#13$3","focus":"r","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"总之，大家都在……这真是……太好了……","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉环顾周围的人群，终于长出了一口气。虽然每个人都已经疲惫到了极点，人群间依然弥漫着劫后余生的喜悦。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"接着，她的神情又突然紧张起来。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#10$3","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"对了……你有看到九吗？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"“九”？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉的目光热切地在人群中搜寻，却迟迟没有找到那位斐迪亚的身影。她当然知道这样是徒劳，如果九的确在这里，又怎会默不作声？","id":166},{"type":"text","text":"可是……","id":167},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#5$3","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"不……绝不该这样……","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"塔露拉，有情况。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"有一支集团军小队追过来了，离我们很近。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","channel":"leaf","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","channel":"walk","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"leaf","fadetime":"0.5","id":186},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"walk","fadetime":"0.5","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#1$3","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"就在前面了。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#2$3","focus":"r","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"望远镜中，一支在山林中穿梭的队伍清晰可见。他们身上的深色军服在这片雪林格外扎眼。","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我很确定，在我们撤离的时候，战场上的集团军阵线的确崩溃了才对。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"他们能在这么短的时间里重新组织搜捕？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#1$3","focus":"r","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"永远不要低估正规军的纪律，我见过了他们的将领，是个难缠的敌人。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"可是这支队伍看上去人数也不多，怎么敢这样孤军深入？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4247_oxi_1#1$3","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你在这里戒备，绝对不能让他们靠近我们的大部队。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我带人去截断他们的退路，无论如何，绝对不能让他们把我们的消息传递回去。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_4247_oxi_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"明白。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉再一次握紧了手中的剑。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"一夜鏖战，她开始感到手中巨剑变得沉重。","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"离上一次让这把剑沾满鲜血已经过去了很久，塔露拉快要忘了任由愤怒来驱使它是什么感觉。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"可是现在，她做不到不去想泽尔格勒的惨状，那些永远被留在这里的同胞……还有他们差一点就能得到的，属于自己的家园。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉快要逼近那一小股集团军的队伍，她很确信自己的火焰随时可以让他们身陷火海。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"但不知为什么，那支队伍的行军速度渐渐慢了下来，甚至开始原地休整。","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"这是——","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"background","id":229},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":230,"musicid":3},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_79_i14.png","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"-80","y":"-20","id":231},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","duration":"15","block":"false","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"——怎么回事……？","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着——","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"在那一件件厚实的军装下，塔露拉终于见到了熟悉的面孔。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"九？","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"还有西尔卡，我还以为——","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……怎么会是……你们……","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……好久不见……","id":242},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":243},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"image","id":247},{"type":"bgeffect","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":249},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":253,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"……","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2440_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的侍从","text":"大人，我们——","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2440_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"所以，在内卫之后……","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"……跟着我们的那些人……都离开了吗？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"那个叫“希尔达”的女孩，还有跟随她的感染者……","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2440_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的侍从","text":"是的。最后那两个“怪胎”刚刚也离开了。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2440_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"……哈。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"如果不是她提出来，沉浸在恐慌中的人们怕是都忘了，原来还有“逃离乌萨斯”这个选项吧。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"那些感染者将她当作救世主的模样，也就说得通了。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2440_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的侍从","text":"可并不是所有人都这样想，大人。选择背弃与遗忘故土的人毕竟是少数中的少数，更多人都还期盼着您能回到圣骏堡。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2440_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"不必浪费时间说这些宽慰我的话语了。维特……不知道现在他在什么地方。总之，我们该去哪儿？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2440_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的侍从","text":"前往图利斯卡亚探路的队伍早已经出发了。我们也在剩下的人里，调拨了人手向扎莫列斯报信，了解中央集团军第九师团的情况。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2440_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的侍从","text":"总之，必须先确保您所前往的路线，是绝对安全的。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2440_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"……","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"希望他们……行动顺利。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":283},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_cg_moonmasked.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","fadetime":"0","id":284},{"type":"imagetween","image":"cg_moonmasked","yFrom":"-40","yTo":"40","duration":"30","block":"false","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":287},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":288,"musicid":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"0.5","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻佻的女性","text":"你真的是个温柔的人呀，塔伊西亚。","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻佻的女性","text":"无论心里再怎么厌烦那位小皇帝，还不是站出来，主动为他引开追兵？","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻佻的女性","text":"到底是因为这是希尔达的任务，还是你发自内心地觉得……","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻佻的女性","text":"我们得保护这位可怜的、无助的、受苦受难的……“同胞”？","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的女性","text":"……","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的女性","text":"请闭嘴吧，佐莱达小姐。","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"image","id":299},{"type":"background","id":300},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","y":"0","x":"0","flip":"true","id":301},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_79_i34.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":302},{"type":"imagetween","image":"79_i34","xScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.25","yScaleFrom":"1","yScaleTo":"1.25","duration":"30","yTo":"-80","block":"false","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"这只是我个人的任务。她并没有让您也留下。","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"哦，可怜的塔伊奇卡——你长到这么大，这么强壮，却都还不知道朋友是什么吧？否则，你怎么会说出这样糊涂的话来呢？","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"朋友，就是我这样的呀。主动陪着你，赴汤蹈火——","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"不必用纯洁和高尚的理由来粉饰您逗留的目的。","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"您想看戏，无所谓，但至少请不要……妨碍我。","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"不行啊。就算是看戏，都还得先瞧瞧这里有些什么剧本呢。","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"毕竟，也不是所有亡国的戏码都值得近距离观赏。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"如果有人执着寻死，倒不如尊重他的决定。在这点上，我和那小兔子的看法一样。","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"……别再让我听到您这样称呼她。","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"也别再用您那肮脏的嘴，把自己同“她”相提并论。","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"可是啊，塔伊西亚。","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"你认为她能救赎一切，可又有谁……当真能救赎万事万物呢？","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"……","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"哦，不过针对眼下的问题，我还是必须得问——","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"无论如何，我都会完成她的嘱托。","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"既然希尔达要他活下来，那他就必须活着……","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔伊西亚","text":"活下来，活到死。","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"……","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"当面包里没有了盐♪","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"灯塔上也不再亮光♪","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"那伟岸帝国的黑夜，就静静地笼罩♪","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佐莱达","text":"……是呀，多熟悉的剧本啊。","id":329},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"image","id":334},{"type":"bgeffect","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_bg_79_g20_snowbattlefield.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":340,"musicid":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2441_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的步兵","text":"队长，前锋来报，除开一直跟进的整合运动踪迹之外，我们又发现了一支疑似集团军快速反应部队的队伍。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2441_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"编队标准？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2441_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的步兵","text":"集团军标准侦察队，十二人。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2441_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"方向是？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2441_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的步兵","text":"扎莫列斯及其附属卫星城辐射圈。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2441_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"中央集团军的驻地？难道是漏网的败将残兵，要去与第九师团会合……具体人员分布呢？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2441_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的步兵","text":"需要进一步接触。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2441_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"那就立刻带队去确认。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2441_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的步兵","text":"您呢？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2441_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"我去继续追踪那群感染者。不管是那个白发的瓦伊凡，还是暂时不知去向的希尔达——","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2423_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅罗米尔","text":"我不会放过她们之中的任何一个。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_2423_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":373,"musicid":7},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"抱歉……我来晚了。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"别说这些了，你们能在这个时候赶回来，取得这样的战果，已经是奇迹。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"请告诉我……我们失去了多少同伴——","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……很多。雷德他们已经在尽量清点伤亡人数了。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"第一集团军不会善罢甘休，我们也必须尽快决定下一步的计划了。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"乌卡边境的据点已经暴露，恐怕我们不能继续在南方逗留。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"难道你打算回到北方去？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"不——当然不！","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"无论如何，我们应该尽可能保留剩下的队伍，也许在东方，或者是更西南方，还能找到下一个据点……","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":395},{"type":"charslot","id":396},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我不明白，塔露拉，为什么在你看来，我们只有四处躲藏一条路可走？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$humanity_g2_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_humanity_g2_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":403,"musicid":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"米拉娜……？","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"还没有听你介绍过，这位是？","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"她是米拉娜，是我们在泽尔格勒结识的伙伴。她带领一支队伍加入了我们。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"她也是一位……了不起的战士。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"塔露拉说起过你，九小姐，很高兴见到你。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"遗憾，这不是一个欢迎新同伴的好时机。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"现在对于整合运动而言，也许是一个绝无仅有的好时机。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"塔露拉，你还记得吗，我们之前听到的中央区动荡的消息。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你是说——","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"这应当是我们的机会……我们应该到中央区去。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"不……不。怎么可以这样冒险？","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"如果消息为真，中央区正是集团军大动干戈的地方，我们要怎样带领现在的队伍面对可能遭遇的战斗？","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"正是在敌人最混乱的地方，最有可能寻觅到战机。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"这实在是太过冒险——","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"每一条路都是冒险的。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"如果我们继续逃窜下去，难道我们要寄希望于中部的第七集团军会对感染者心慈手软，还是卡西米尔人对感染者网开一面？","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我们只能斗争，不停地斗争……去压迫最深重的地方唤起同伴，去最危险的地方寻找击破敌人的良机。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我们一路走来见证的一切还不够清晰吗？我们怎么能够通过保守的行动来躲避悲剧的发生？","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"放弃斗争当然可以让我们不用背负使同伴牺牲的罪责，难道因此就可以坦然接受无所作为的结果？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"斗争必须要坚持下去，我们绝不能软弱……把软弱留给我们的敌人吧，留给那些永远身居高位，习惯了玩弄别人命运的人。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"应该让他们来惧怕我们。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"——！","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"charslot","id":442},{"type":"background","id":443},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_79_i15.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":444},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","xTo":"-50","duration":"25","block":"false","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"米拉娜转过了身，但塔露拉忘不了刚刚与她对上的眼神。","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的青年是如此赤诚，自己仿佛要被她的热情所灼痛。","id":449},{"type":"text","text":"这些坚定的话语似乎触及了塔露拉心底许久不曾展露的热血，也触及了她快要忘记的恐惧。","id":450},{"type":"text","text":"到底是为什么……","id":451},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉无端地感到一股心悸。","id":452},{"type":"text","text":"脑海中涌起了无数回忆，塔露拉无法从繁杂的思绪中准确捕捉到那一丝令她不安的念头。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"就算所有人都想要得到一个好结果——这些人却依然会失败。","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"除非我们结束掉这一连串的平庸年月。","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"——！","id":456},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"charslot","id":459},{"type":"image","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":461},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":462},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……先到这吧。","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"……","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"这样下去也争不出个结果，我们今天先安营休息。我们的队伍都疲惫到极点了。","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"我不知道你们说的中央区的乱局到底是怎么回事，听上去你们手上的情报也不够多。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"先休整队伍，再努力多获取一些情报。时间紧张，也不能盲目下判断。","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2420_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你说得对……我们都需要喘一口气。","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_2420_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":475},{"type":"multiline","name":"九","text":"喘口气，多收集一点情报……","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":477},{"type":"multiline","name":"九","text":"哈，要说起收集情报，我倒是也遇到了一位能信任的同伴——","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"西尔卡……？","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":481},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":482},{"type":"dialog","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"bgeffect","id":486},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":487},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_bg_79_g20_snowbattlefield.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":488},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":489},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":490},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":492},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"……源石技艺的使用痕迹就结束在这附近……","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"古怪，用这样的源石技艺一定是为了隐藏踪迹，可为什么到这里就停了？这地方还远不算安全区。","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":496},{"type":"charslot","id":497},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":498,"musicid":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的声音","text":"——谁？！","id":499},{"type":"dialog","id":500},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2458_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":501},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的士兵","text":"站、站住！不要再往前了！","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_2458_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#3$1","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"……中央集团军？","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2458_1#1$1","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的士兵","text":"你——","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_2458_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":508},{"type":"charslot","id":509},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowtarget","id":510},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"士兵手中的弩箭猛地一颤，仅剩的箭矢瞬发，却射偏了方向，没能伤到对方分毫。","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#1$1","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"你是个新兵。你应该也不会使用源石技艺，一路上帮你们掩盖踪迹的另有其人。","id":514,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2458_1#1$1","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的士兵","text":"你在说什么？我警告你——","id":516,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_2458_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"告诉我，你们还剩多少人，又为什么会出现在这里？","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#7$1","id":519},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"本应在中央区驻守的集团军却逃窜到南方，难道圣骏堡真出了什么问题……","id":520,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是啊，这意味着圣骏堡陷落了。你们听到的一切都是真的。","id":522},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#4$1","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"——？！","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2458_1#1$1","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的士兵","text":"大人！您不应该——","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_2458_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"叛徒……从来都在帝国的心脏之中。如果我能——","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……呵。不，现在说这些又有什么用呢？都是空话。","id":529},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"你又是……","id":531,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":532},{"type":"charslot","id":533},{"type":"text","text":"青年推开挡在他身前的士兵，走上前去，直视提问的人。","id":534},{"type":"dialog","id":535},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":536},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":537},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":538},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恍惚的青年","text":"一路上，都是他们在保护我。我不知道你是哪支追兵的手下，不过既然你已经找到我了……","id":539,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":540},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恍惚的青年","text":"不管你是否同样为杀我而来，我都不会再躲在他们身后了。","id":541,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2155_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"……","id":543,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"呵，我还真是……找到了不得了的东西。","id":545,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":546},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":547},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":548},{"type":"bgeffect","id":549},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":550},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":551},{"type":"image","id":552},{"type":"charslot","id":553}],"characters":["塔露拉","雅罗米尔","紧急的战报","集团军指挥","斯韦特兰纳","米拉娜","雷德","九","费奥多尔","沉稳的侍从","轻佻的女性","寡言的女性","塔伊西亚","佐莱达","谨慎的步兵","？？？","西尔卡","警惕的声音","警惕的士兵","恍惚的青年"]}